.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_MD-SHA3 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_MD-SHA3
.Nd The SHA3 EVP_MD implementations
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Support for computing SHA3 digests through the
.Sy EVP_MD
API.
.Ss Identities
This implementation is available with the FIPS provider as well as the
default provider, and includes the following varieties:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqSHA3-224"
.It \(dqSHA3-256"
.It \(dqSHA3-384"
.It \(dqSHA3-512"
.El
.Ss Gettable Parameters
This implementation supports the common gettable parameters described in
.Xr EVP_MD-common 7 .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr provider-digest 7 ,
.Xr OSSL_PROVIDER-FIPS 7 ,
.Xr OSSL_PROVIDER-default 7
